OL,3,GNEWSAFrom living in a Ukrainian shelter
OL,4,Ato a new life
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Thanks to this family, we have
OL,7,Feverything we need here; kind words and
OL,8,Fsometimes kind hugs."
OL,10,FOlena Mikheionok, 41, fled the occupied
OL,11,FLuhansk region of Ukraine in July 2025
OL,12,Fwith her now three-year-old son Mikita.
OL,14,FThe apartment she lived in with her son
OL,15,Fand her father had been destroyed by a
OL,16,Fbomb and she had been living in
OL,17,Fshelters before moving in with her
OL,18,Fsister and family into a small
OL,19,Ftwo-bedroom flat.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
