OL,3,GNEWSAFrom living in a Ukrainian shelter
OL,4,Ato a new life
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was then that Mikheionok took the
OL,7,Fdecision to flee Ukraine with the help
OL,8,Fof the charity Refugees at Home.
